      "words": 50
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Guilt overwhelms me when a guy flirts with me at the restaurant. When you work as a server, it’s inevitable. I’ve starte",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1040
        }
      ],
      "words": 30
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I’m doing exactly what I said I didn’t want to do. Sometimes I just think about letting him go to make it easier. It’s w",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1379
        }
      ],
      "words": 30
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Done talking with your boyfriend?” She snickers. Her friend, Laura, looks over at me. She knows how Eloise is, and alwa",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2026
        }
      ],
      "words": 32
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“No, right, it’s just the boy you pull along on a little string like a hoe bag.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2446
        }
      ],
      "words": 17
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“The fact that he’s actually doing something with his life, he is probably too good for you anyhow. You waste your life ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2923
        }
      ],
      "words": 29
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He knows it was a dig at him too. She always tears him down because he manages a pub. There is a reason he stays at work",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3163
        }
      ],
      "words": 67
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Hi, baby girl,” he says, kissing me on the forehead. “How’s Sean?”",
          "ok": true,
